{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.copySlice\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">copySlice</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">dest</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">destOff </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exact</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Copies the elements of `src` from index `srcOff` up to, but not including, `srcOff + len` into\n`dest` starting at index `destOff`, growing `dest` if necessary. The copy works in place when `dest`\nis not shared and has room. If `exact` is `false`, the capacity is doubled when `dest` grows.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.copySlice","kind":"def","line":414,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.copySlice","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L414-L423"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.instAppend\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">instAppend</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Append\">Append</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.instAppend","kind":"instance","line":396,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.instAppend","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L396-L396"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.append\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">append</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the elements of `b` to `a`, in place when `a` is not shared and has room.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.append","kind":"def","line":391,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.append","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L391-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.push\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">push</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#ISize\">ISize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends `v` to `a`, in place when `a` is not shared and has room. A full array grows to capacity\n`2 * capacity + 1`, so repeated pushes take amortized constant time.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.push","kind":"def","line":354,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.push","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L354-L360"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">pushImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#ISize\">ISize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushImpl","kind":"def","line":341,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L341-L352"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushGrowUnsafe\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">pushGrowUnsafe</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#ISize\">ISize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`push` when `a` is full: copies `a` with capacity `2 * capacity + 1`, then appends `v`. Out of\nline so that inlined `push` call sites stay small. Public only so that `push` can be inlined into\ncode in other modules.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushGrowUnsafe","kind":"def","line":326,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.pushGrowUnsafe","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L326-L339"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.instGetElemUSizeISizeLtNatToNatSize\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">instGetElemUSizeISizeLtNatToN