>a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#ISize\">ISize</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.toArrayImpl","kind":"def","line":201,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.toArrayImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L201-L222"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.mkImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#ISize\">ISize</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.mkImpl","kind":"def","line":186,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.mkImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L186-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureExclusiveWithCapacity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `a` itself when it is not shared and has room for `n` elements, and otherwise a single copy\nwith room for exactly `max n a.size` elements. Logically this is the identity. It is useful before a\nrun of in-place writes and pushes, so that none of them copies.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity","kind":"def","line":164,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L164-L170"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl","kind":"def","line":156,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L156-L162"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacity\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `a` itself when it has room for `n` elements, and otherwise a copy with room for exactly\n`max n a.size` elements. Logically this is the identity. Unlike `ensureExclusiveWithCapacity`, it\ndoes not copy `a` just because it is shared.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacity","kind":"def","line":148,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L148-L154"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacityImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacityImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacityImpl","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacityImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.lean#L141-L146"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`ensureCapacity` and `ensureExclusiveWithCapacity` when `a` lacks room for `n` elements: copies `a`\nwith room for exactly `max n a.size` elements. Out of line so that inlined call sites stay small.\nPublic only so that those functions can be inlined into code in other modules.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/